{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dd2bf901986e47ee03d83351f53f6a168ec305be333eb2cc0dcccaf28363cfe3", "ja": "千鶴さん。新しい衣装、よくお似合いです。\n着心地はどうですか？", "zh": "千鹤小姐。新衣服很适合您。\n穿起来感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "6d8dd3dd43eee3e230bac1fdf4cc501bc7d7d08a98adb1d445b65f8e3902ed91", "ja": "{$P$}。ええ、とっても良いですわ。\n初めて着たのに、ぴったり合いますのね。", "zh": "{$P$}。嗯，非常好呢。\n明明是第一次穿，却正合身呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "5394901a198e1cd42fb0bb8400de46e71a26b453c91204444d54b784e08a478e", "ja": "着心地や見た目ももちろん気に入りましたけど\n何よりも……気持ちが馴染む感じです。", "zh": "我当然也很喜欢穿着的感觉和外观，\n最重要的是……感觉自己的心情也融入其中了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fdaa75e3ecd82b091296221f8aa42c42b362a2c3b8dbc88f4125fd4efc363913", "ja": "気持ちが……それなら良かった。千鶴さんの\n世界観や歌い方に合わせた衣装ですからね。", "zh": "心情……那就太好了。这套服装可是配合千鹤小姐的世界观和演唱方式设计的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "9a5a31e091974e78fe9e3dbeff7a96ba0b0971ecdcb7c7c4e427d020bbdbac3b", "ja": "わたくしのための衣装、ということですわね。\nたくさん考えてくださったこと、感謝いたしますわ！", "zh": "也就是说，这是为了我而打造的服装对吧。\n承蒙您如此费心考虑，我不胜感激！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "ef0ca4ea04dbb2b7b2b006caf57a860c316ca1662af2512d4efd339404586921", "ja": "わたくしはセレブでアイドル。きらめく星々のように\n常に美しくあらねばなりません。", "zh": "我可是名媛兼偶像，必须像闪耀的群星一样，\n时刻保持美丽才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "6f538513f1a777bad5ef614d8b241ca8d0f27b08f8857ce01561161d6dcc1a58", "ja": "わたくしに期待をかけてくださる方々がいますから。\n例えそれが、偽りの仮面だったとしても……。", "zh": "因为有许多人对我寄予期待。即使那只是一副虚假的面具……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0e9c6c8aac60e24411ff1896fb8697e91bd6849c26100082c895e4d3a71b5e80", "ja": "なるほど。己を演出するのは、\nアイドルにとっても、大事なことだと思います。", "zh": "原来如此。我觉得，塑造自己的形象，对偶像来说也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "d5992f913be2512ed0cec4fe2061c3953c88faebb0474ddba3aa193077f70a8c", "ja": "ふふっ……{$P$}、\n貴方にも、隠された姿があるのではなくて？", "zh": "呵呵……{$P$}，\n您应该也有不为人知的一面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a2805719d763006169666c0d3723925d9024eb21014ad2a95fa4cbd3666efe8c", "ja": "えっ？　いえ、特には……。\nまあ、仕事とプライベートは分けていますけど。", "zh": "诶？不，没什么特别的……\n不过，工作和私人生活还是分开的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "31765fa87e95d1b2bd23540c48e275d396409b6aea16cca04547d6113991d480", "ja": "そうでしょうとも！\n立場がある者ならば、演じることは必然です。", "zh": "当然如此！\n既然身处这个位置，戴上面具也是必然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "85ddd38a2d3e9a127b3ec1ba1f86ffe94039a09f7d29cd080e23d89fb06da69a", "ja": "素顔をそのまま晒すわけにはいきません。\n誰の夢も、壊したくありませんから。", "zh": "我不能就这样展示真实的自己。\n因为我不想破坏任何人的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ed1940e319853a6437a79cf43cb583770933de8d7e268f36834bae5ea193a113", "ja": "さすがですね。そんな千鶴さんの演技は、\nいつも素晴らしいと思って見ていますよ。", "zh": "真不愧是千鹤小姐。您的演技一直都很精彩，我总是这样看着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "05488b2ff5a073fe7963d3c20d8e98e8d61e0f36672240567e3c9a15cf3158a7", "ja": "えっ……！？", "zh": "咦……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cfb744aa371ef22f65500802d9be5d6c2bb9f2ac885a7fd2dbce315baf32f7c8", "ja": "特に、演じ分けが凄いなって。\n色々な役を、しっかりとこなしてくれますから。", "zh": "尤其是，你驾驭不同角色的能力很厉害。\n因为无论什么角色，你都能好好地演绎出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "5ffd384c70716b25c232788b114fb22080d2963023a132b8a3ea2c77d6378bb4", "ja": "あ、そういう……ま、まあ、そう言って\nいただければ幸いですわ！　おーっほっほっほ！", "zh": "啊，是这样……既、既然您这么说，那我就很荣幸了！哦呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "ecaa45774dd2660904023c81018664886944218169b03b2a64a7e5686e0fa735", "ja": "そうですわね、コツがあるとするなら……。\n表面ではなく、本質を捉えることかしら。", "zh": "是呢，如果说有什么诀窍的话……应该就是不看表面，而是抓住本质吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "19a182de11aa04536627a43a94a3d8afab7535187fdcefdd3cbaa1adddebac22", "ja": "でも時々、悩んでしまいますの。色々な役を\n演じていると、どれが本物のわたくしなのか、と。", "zh": "不过有时，我也会感到烦恼。扮演了各种各样的角色后，我会想，究竟哪一个才是真正的我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8c68ad244c4e7a2009899987c201fc570123cafd3155c8a8282922cecec61059", "ja": "演技に入り込みすぎると、そうなるのかも\nしれませんね……でも、千鶴さんは千鶴さんですよ。", "zh": "可能是因为太过投入角色，才会变成这样吧……不过，千鹤小姐就是千鹤小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c4f9a7b6ad2cd8401d6b9a539387aba7ba7d7667e29834bf0c273f98b7f69fe7", "ja": "こうして目の前にいて、会話をしている。\nそれが全てです。", "zh": "就这样在我面前，和我交谈着。\n这就是全部。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "45eb8b4d3a61cf94ed00631b8e21a6b434e42db79f614fbec72292497eb3340e", "ja": "今、こうしているわたくしが、全て……。\nそうかもしれませんわね、ふふっ。", "zh": "此刻这样面对着您的我，就是全部……  \n或许确实如此呢，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "f94fa90b81712e6eedd6ad61656d9d42a992a8c6b1b6f1a8764e3107ebd00c82", "ja": "わたくしにとっても、今こうして目の前にいる\n貴方が、全てですから。{$P$}。", "zh": "对我来说，现在像这样在我眼前的\n您，就是一切。{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0244_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "50254b5f2af2eb2cc38e6e8c3a4d5313e367ce20262eef20f34f2b4ef040f25c", "ja": "ありがとうございます。この衣装で……。\nもっと素晴らしい演技を、お見せしますわね。", "zh": "谢谢您。有了这身服装……  \n我会为您展现更加精彩的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
